The failure is localized to this sandbox’s Lean application-path detection: the pinned binaries and libraries are present, but `lean --version` cannot locate its own executable. I’m testing a narrow `/proc/self/exe` compatibility shim in `/tmp` so the trusted preflight can run unchanged; any result will be labeled with that environment workaround rather than silently treated as native.
